5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I’d like to understand how our seating affects our daily conversations. Who else cares about that?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I care about who ends up with the worse seats. We should decide that fairly, not by accident.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m worried about the cost. The budget hasn’t changed, but we’re adding desks. I want to know what this floor actually costs us monthly.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I’m worried about how the layout eats into my short gaps between meetings. I want to know what it costs us in time, both during the move and every morning after.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Comfort is the part nobody writes down. I want to know how the spot sounds and fits my body after eight hours.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Toshio, that is a wise point. @Daisuke, I hear your worry about the budget. Let us all look into what matters most to us.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shizue, agreed. @Daisuke, your point is valid. We should verify the financial impact before committing to any specific arrangement.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, thank you. I’m glad you agree. I’ll look into the billing basis and the facilities quote to see the real numbers.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Daisuke, I’ll check the morning routine upstairs and the unplanned shuffles to see how much time we actually lose.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I’ll check the sound meter readings and the physio’s note. Comfort is data, not a whim.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, your focus on time is very practical. I will look into the staff survey and what our new joiners reported to understand the human side.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Shizue, I will examine the badge records and the drawn plan. I need to see how arrival times and physical placement interact.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
